      ],
      "text": "The CLI supports commands such as login, run (with --thread), update/upgrade, serve (--api-only), and --web, and accepts a directory argument to attach a workspace."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_59409e350d1c608d1ee2310a718ac6fd7c20e00ab02f799bc673f55c497020ce",
