        "slc_e0b3fb49dfe9777fb408dc078b6ff890c3b32ab0ff73afbccaa11d72f02ca2e2"
      ],
      "text": "Server behavior is configurable via environment variables including SPROCKET_DATA_DIR, SPROCKET_PORT (default 17731), SPROCKET_HOST (default 127.0.0.1), and SPROCKET_DESKTOP_EXECUTABLE."
    },
    {
