          "git_sha": "aee79ebafbb29f15b9c66680512dbf639895ce25",
          "line_end": 280,
          "line_start": 253,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "spikonado/sprocket",
          "url": "https://github.com/spikonado/sprocket/blob/f705b4375ade23ebcf6e30c082f977e42297cc12/ARCHITECTURE.md#L253-L280"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_34337b667eb8c1b7f0ff109f32a359fab8fea7b073cdea8c51ac96752e7c8214",
        "slc_bf29ecf3b4baca564346de412a8c13c724e88dec7b38b39bdec71c59ae70c067"
      ],
      "text": "State is split by owner: Convex holds users, threads, durable transcript parts, runs, and tool-job records, while the local server keeps a thread summary cache, transcript replica, folder list, and pairing credentials; the WorkOS refresh token lives in the OS credential store."
    },
