  "summary": "Sprocket is an agentic hardware/software development platform combining a Svelte web UI, Electron desktop shell, npm CLI, local Rust server, Convex cloud backend, and an external AI gateway. Evidence covers CLI usage, architecture, state ownership, authentication, artifact tooling, and extensive backwards-compatibility migrations; no agent performance evaluation is documented. Evidence coverage: 127 of 192 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
